{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Character｜初始化流程图\nSystem提供同GI原生顺序；各feature独立推进，Extension唯一分发PawnData配置。\nHost/ASC发布、Base/Health订阅与Hero输入各有独立生命周期；Closing不证明原生退出成功，InitState不授ASC Ready。\n[[GGYGO_结构_角色与组件.canvas|结构图]] · [[Character/结构|结构文档]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1650,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GameMode / BossEncounter 生成 Pawn，装入 PawnData。\n\n玩家：GameMode::SpawnSquadMember/SpawnSquadSlot；Boss：BossEncounter::SpawnBoss；对 PawnExtension::SetPawnData(Data)。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "owner",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Slot 或 BossState 先拥有 ASC、基础属性与 Authority 授予的能力。\n\nAuthority 初始化安装 ASC 规则并调用 AbilitySet；客户端在 PawnData / BossDefinition OnRep 后只幂等安装 AbilityGroupConfig 与 TagRelationshipMapping。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 宿主绑定\nHost AttachAvatar（服务器）／OnRep_AvatarPawn（客户端）→ 释放旧Avatar → InitAbilityActorInfo(宿主, Pawn)。\n→ Extension HandleAbilitySystemBound → 广播Ready；订阅者（Health、Hero、CMC、LocomotionFX）各自消费。\n绑定进行中再请求 → Reentrant，不嵌套。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "init",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. Extension｜唯一配置分发\nSetPawnData／Controller／feature通知→CheckDefaultInitialization进入原同步scope；先推进其他feature，再ContinueInitStateChain。\n原Manager查询HaveAllFeaturesReachedInitState(Pawn,DataAvailable)。\n所有feature≥DataAvailable→HandleChangeInitState(DataInitialized)→ApplyPawnDataToConsumers嵌套scope→原CMC SetMovementSet(PawnData->MovementSet)。\n各feature独立推进；本链不发布ASC Ready，标签不证明Set接受。\n[[Character/结构#原 PawnData 同步初始化调用|同步调用契约]]",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 玩家分支｜Hero原生输入装配\nBeginPlay／Setup→InitializePlayerInput。\nHero只等Extension≥DataAvailable，可先到GameplayReady。\nReady H关联；首Triggered锁观察/截止→Receive。\nClosing→退休匹配关联/观察→原SourceASC End(ID,Invalidated)；保留绑定/IMC/Action锁存。\n等待许可归ASC；Released／自身退出清原会话。\n移动Started／OwnerSync Ready→原Source仍Held→原准入；按来源清Session/Binding/Observer。\n[[Input/结构|能力输入]] · [[Movement/结构|移动准入与执行]]",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 878,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "boss",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Boss 分支：AIController 驱动 BT，Pawn 不需要玩家 Hero 输入组件。\n\n调用：BossAIController 驱动 BehaviorTree；BTTask 通过 BossState::GetGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent 访问 ASC。",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "pyrios-visual",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "玩家视觉支路：`AGGYGOHeroCharacter` 的 `StylizedRenderComponent::BeginPlay` 读取已就绪的 Mesh，调用 `RefreshMaterials()` 建立 MID 与描边。\n不等待 ASC / InitState；非 Pyrois Mesh 无匹配时保持原材质。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Pyrios渲染.canvas|展开材质、主光与描边链路]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 820,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 265,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "unbind",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 释放链\nDetach／替换／宿主销毁／Avatar OnEndPlay或OnDestroyed（仍是当前Avatar时）→ ReleaseAvatar。\n取消能力（保留SurvivesDeath）→ 清输入 → 移除Cue → Owner-only（宿主关闭时ClearActorInfo）。\n→ Extension HandleAbilitySystemReleased：先清资源再广播Released，只发给消费过该资源的订阅。",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 986,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "death-projection",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Health唯一死亡阶段\nNotDead→DeathStarted→DeathFinished；阶段改变才发对应事件。\n原Ready H：StartDeath投影Dying，FinishDeath投影Dying+Dead。\n未绑定仍推进阶段；晚装配只补Tag、不重播事件。解绑不清Tag，不隐式复活。\nAuthority死亡Host拒绝不同新Avatar；准入归Host。",
      "x": 1460,
      "y": 1245,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-phases",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 绑定、订阅与退出\n绑定顺序（Lyra）：释放旧Avatar → InitAbilityActorInfo(宿主, 新Pawn) → 订阅新Pawn的OnEndPlay/OnDestroyed → 服务器写AvatarPawn → 新Pawn的Extension广播Ready。\n订阅：Subscribe即回放当前Ready；重复Ready不回调；分发前复制订阅表，Ready分发中资源被替换则停止。\nReleased在ActorInfo解除之后广播，只发给消费过同一资源的订阅；订阅者各自归还自己的资源（Hero输入会话、Health五token、CMC移动来源、LocomotionFX发布）。\nController变化只RefreshAbilityActorInfo，不经宿主；换人不重绑。\n[[Character/结构#PawnExtension 本地 ASC 订阅|本地订阅]] · [[Combatants/结构#绑定与释放顺序|宿主顺序]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构#Avatar 绑定|ASC]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 1890,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "health-original-resource-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 360,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Health订阅链\nOnRegister（游戏世界）或BeginPlay → 订阅本Pawn的Extension；已有Ready立即回放。\nReady → 取HealthSet，安装五委托token → 投影既有DeathState → UI初值。\nReleased或资源替换 → 精确移除自己的五token；EndPlay/OnUnregister独立退订。\nDeathState唯一归Health，数值归HealthSet；本Pawn/资源不符或未Ready → 明确失败，不绑定替代资源。\nBase死亡事件关闭移动/碰撞并安排下一帧退场；常改演出由蓝图消费。\n[[Character/结构#Health 订阅与五委托|接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "system-initstate-order",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## System｜同GI原生启动前置\nUGameInstance::Init→SubsystemCollection.Initialize→UGGYGOInitStateRegistrationSubsystem::Initialize。\n`InitializeDependency<UGameFrameworkComponentManager>()`取得同一原GI的Manager；RegisterInitState按四阶段锚点登记。\n相邻正向true／逆向false全通过后才输出RegisteredOrder；顺序与feature状态唯一归原Manager，已有逆序明确失败。\nReceiveInit早于本前置；本地StateChain／feature注册不登记全局顺序。\n[[System/结构|System注册契约]]",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 335,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn-data-sync-call",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原同步初始化调用在途\nCheckDefaultInitialization进入FPawnDataInitializationScope。\nCheckDefaultInitializationForImplementers→同步推进Hero等原feature，再ContinueInitStateChain。\nHandleChangeInitState(DataInitialized)→ApplyPawnDataToConsumers建立嵌套scope→SetMovementSet→Cue预热请求。\n组件仅借用当前栈记录；公开IsPawnDataInitializationInProgress() const只读原Extension/Pawn/World与登记/生命周期，返回原同步在途bool。\n不等待Cue异步完成，不提交accepted/ASC Ready，不改原调度。\n[[Character/结构#原 PawnData 同步初始化调用|接口与所有权]]",
      "x": 2890,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement-startup-scope-qualification",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 启动表现读取｜CMC唯一限定\nCamera/Animation读取GetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot() const。\n已有accepted Set→沿原配置/源校验和native区间分支；scope不替代配置准入。\n缺Set→先验原CMC/Character/UpdatedComponent、原Extension/GameWorld；Set从未提交、累计native interval=0、Extension未越过DataInitialized才检查暂态。\n① 原Actor未完成BeginPlay：真实构造注册期→Initial，覆盖Anim早于Extension登记。\n② Actor已完成BeginPlay：IsPawnDataInitializationInProgress() const为true→仅本同步栈Initial；为false→明确Invalid。\nnull/拒绝提交、已有native interval、DataInitialized已越过或生命周期关闭→缺Set Invalid。Stop/Reset不抹去Set提交事实。\nSpawned/DataAvailable长停不开放等待；accepted Set唯一归CMC。\n[[Movement/结构|原快照与执行]]",
      "x": 2890,
      "y": 865,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn-data-sync-scope-exit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原scope退出／失效\n正常返回：仅当前指针仍等于自己才恢复原父scope；最外层退出→无scope。\nOnUnregister→先清指针，再Super。\nEndPlay→先关scope准入/清指针，再原资源释放/feature注销；旧析构不恢复失效父scope或覆盖后继。\ngetter的原身份/登记/生命周期失效→false。\n真实后续BeginPlay仅重开准入；须新的原同步调用建立scope。\n构造完成后scope=false且缺accepted Set→后续读取明确Invalid，不按帧重试或建立Ready。",
      "x": 2890,
      "y": 1415,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
